From: Ubuntu Embedded Team <builder@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] rockchip: boot extlinux with FDT overlays before RKIMG

Backport U-Boot commit 69076dff2284 to the Rockchip 2017.09 PXE parser and
make the vendor boot flow usable with an independent extlinux bootfs.

The combined change:

* tries distro/extlinux before the existing RKIMG boot methods;
* scans filesystem partitions even without the GPT legacy-bootable flag;
* parses and applies FDTOVERLAYS in listed order;
* reserves an RK3576 temporary overlay load address;
* preserves an explicit extlinux root= argument during Rockchip FDT fixups;
* removes the superseded RK3576 distro_boot_first wrapper.

If no extlinux entry boots, the original Android/FIT/RKIMG path remains the
fallback.

Upstream-FDTOVERLAYS: 69076dff2284ed099cc0583e5e64bd8012d1ab5c
---
